# Web marketing UI

Read [apps/web/DESIGN.md](../../apps/web/DESIGN.md) before changing web visuals. That file is the source of truth for look and feel.

- Dark canvas (`#09090b`), Geist, porcelain type, one white pill CTA, 780px reading column, sticky frosted header
- DESIGN.md is visual language only. Never add features, sections, or component catalogs to it
- Do not restyle the owner UI (`/d`) from this language. Marketing is forced dark; do not add a theme toggle
- Product facts live in `vision.md` / `architecture.md`. Do not invent metrics, testimonials, or capabilities
